      "purpose": "RPG IV prototype header (copybook) for the libssh2 publickey subsystem C library. Defines data structures (libssh2_publickey_attribute, libssh2_publickey_list) and external procedure prototypes (EXTPROC) mapping to libssh2 C functions such as libssh2_publickey_init, libssh2_publickey_add_ex, libssh2_publickey_remove_ex, libssh2_publickey_list_fetch, libssh2_publickey_list_free, and libssh2_publickey_shutdown. Uses conditional compilation directives (/if not defined / /define / /endif) as an include guard, and /include to pull in the base libssh2 header. Intended to be /copy-included by RPG programs that call the libssh2 publickey subsystem on IBM i.",
